{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28184","headline":"哀蜀人爲南蛮俘虏五章 入蛮界不许有悲泣之声 · 雍陶","name":"哀蜀人爲南蛮俘虏五章 入蛮界不许有悲泣之声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云南路出陷河西，毒草长青瘴色低。\n渐近蛮城谁敢哭，一时收泪羡猨啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}